        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, city car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, city car
The data set reflects the disposal of a light weight BEV with a 100kg LiIo battery. Aluminium and steel parts are fully recycled. Plastics are disposed. ;
UUID: 2b87e6ca-434b-49ee-a42a-33fc94232792
This data set includes the disposal of all remaining parts, that are not recycled. All recycled parts are attributed to the reuse process (cut-off)
Location: Data for disposal of vehicle parts in Europe.
Technology: Disposal to incineration or recycling (metals and batteries)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literture 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2b87e6ca-434b-49ee-a42a-33fc94232792.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
